65.0,"Kerala Man Loses Rs 40,000 To AI-Based Deepfake Scam: Here's What It Is - NDTV",NDTV,"Tue, 18 Jul 2023 07:00:00 GMT",https://www.ndtv.com/india-news/kerala-man-loses-rs-40-000-to-ai-based-deepfake-scam-heres-what-it-is-4217841,success_decoder,success,"Kerala Man Loses Rs 40,000 To AI-Based Deepfake Scam: Here's What It Is",Amit Chaturvedi,2023-07-18,"A man in Kerala's Kozhikode lost Rs 40,000 after falling prey to an artificial intelligence-based scam. According to the police, it was a deepfake scam involving someone who the man knew.
