171.0,Bareilly company director arrested for renting out company's bank account to cyber fraudsters: How networ - The Times of India,The Times of India,"Sun, 20 Jul 2025 07:00:00 GMT",https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/technology/tech-news/bareilly-company-director-arrested-for-renting-out-companys-bank-account-to-cyber-fraudsters-how-network-spread-across-11-states/articleshow/122790076.cms,success_decoder,success,Bareilly company director arrested for renting out company's bank account to cyber fraudsters: How network spread across 11 states - The Times of India,TOI Tech Desk,2025-07-20,"Director of a private company based in Bareilly has been arrested for renting out his company's bank account to cyber criminals. Police has arrested Pradeep Kumar Singh, for allegedly leasing his company's bank account to cybercriminals who siphoned off an estimated Rs 3.2 crore from victims across 11 states. The illicit funds were swiftly converted into USDT cryptocurrency and routed to digital wallets reportedly operating from Hong Kong, significantly complicating recovery efforts.
