One concise email. No spam, unsubscribe anytime.",548,,True,False
335.0,Scammer Used AI MAGA Influencer to Fund Med School and It Surprisingly Worked - Yahoo,Yahoo,"Thu, 23 Apr 2026 07:00:00 GMT",https://www.yahoo.com/news/articles/scammer-used-ai-maga-influencer-102346312.html,success_decoder,success,Scammer Used AI MAGA Influencer to Fund Med School and It Surprisingly Worked,Reni,2026-04-23,"Scammer Used AI MAGA Influencer to Fund Med School and It Surprisingly Worked
