Who Was The AI-Generated MAGA Influencer Netizens Brought Up?
There are currently many AI-generated MAGA influencers that continue to grab the attention of Republicans online.
However, the netizens recently brought up was 'Emily Hart.' This avatar embodies certain aspects of the 'Mar-a-Lago Face.'
