The tool also provided a reason for its choice, claiming that ""older MAGA men were more loyal,"" and had a high income to invest.
Additionally, after generating enough views, Sam subscribed his avatar to Fanvue, an account that is in direct competition with OnlyFans.
Ultimately, all the money generated from Instagram and Fanvue was used to help pay off Sam's medical school bills.
According to the publication's reports, the individual is currently not in the USA but aspires to be there to further his medical studies.",609,,True,False
345.0,First AI voice cloning fraud reported in Indore: Play school head loses savings after fraudster mimics cous... - Bhaskar English,Bhaskar English,"Tue, 06 Jan 2026 08:00:00 GMT",https://www.bhaskarenglish.in/local/mp/news/first-ai-voice-cloning-fraud-reported-in-indore-play-school-head-loses-savings-in-cousin-voice-emergency-scam-136911363.html,success_decoder,success,First AI voice cloning fraud reported in Indore: Play school head loses savings after fraudster mimics cousin's voice in emergency scam call - Madhya Pradesh News,Tarun Tiwari,2026-01-10,"- English News
