373.0,"Hyderabad: 3,000 People Defrauded In Stock Market Scam, Police Arrest 2 - Free Press Journal",Free Press Journal,"Thu, 21 Aug 2025 07:00:00 GMT",https://www.freepressjournal.in/business/hyderabad-3000-people-defrauded-in-stock-market-scam-police-arrest-2,success_decoder,success,"Hyderabad: 3,000 People Defrauded In Stock Market Scam, Police Arrest 2",Tresha Dias,2025-08-21,"The Hyderabad cybercrime police arrested two individuals from AV Solutions, dismantling a large-scale, organised financial fraud operation. Ponzi scheme tactics and advanced AI-powered investment platforms were used for a criminal operation.
