385.0,Truecaller's New AI Call Scanner will make it harder for scammers to trick people - India Today,India Today,"Thu, 30 May 2024 07:00:00 GMT",https://www.indiatoday.in/technology/news/story/hackers-can-no-longer-trick-people-with-ai-voice-clone-scams-thanks-to-truecallers-new-ai-call-scanner-2545713-2024-05-30,success_decoder,success,Truecaller’s New AI Call Scanner will make it harder for scammers to trick people,India Today Tech,2024-05-30,"Truecaller's New AI Call Scanner will make it harder for scammers to trick people
Truecaller has launched the AI Call Scanner, a new tool to detect AI-generated fake calls, helping users avoid scams.
In today's fast-paced world, technology is advancing rapidly, and with it, new threats are emerging. One such threat is AI voice cloning, which allows scammers to mimic anyone’s voice with just three seconds of audio. This means fraudsters can trick people by pretending to be their loved ones in distress. However, Truecaller has introduced a new tool to combat this menace: the AI Call Scanner.
Truecaller, known for its efforts in fighting spam and scams, has launched the AI Call Scanner to help users detect fake calls. This new feature can tell the difference between real human voices and AI-generated ones, helping people avoid being tricked. The AI Call Scanner is available in the Truecaller app for Android users who have a Premium subscription. It is being rolled out first in the US, with plans to expand to India and other major markets soon.
Using the AI Call Scanner is easy. If you get a suspicious call, you just tap a button in the Truecaller app. The caller’s voice is recorded and quickly analyzed by Truecaller’s advanced technology. Within a few seconds, the app will tell you if the voice is real or fake. This quick and accurate tool can help users stay safe from scams.
Alan Mamedi, CEO and Co-founder of Truecaller, explained why this feature is so important. “AI voice scams are becoming more common because it’s easier to create fake voices. We needed to find a solution before it got worse. Truecaller is now the first app to have built-in AI voice detection, helping to protect our users from these scams,” he said.
While the AI Call Scanner is starting on Android, Truecaller is also working on an iOS version. They are continuously improving the technology to make it even more accurate and faster. The company is also looking at ways to use the AI Call Scanner with other communication platforms and devices. One idea is to create a chatbot where users can send recorded clips for checking, making it even easier to use.
With the AI Call Scanner, Truecaller is taking a big step in protecting people from sophisticated scams. This new tool gives users the power to identify and block fake voices, ensuring safer communication. As technology continues to evolve, Truecaller remains committed to keeping our interactions safe and secure. This new feature is a significant development in the ongoing fight against digital fraud, offering hope and protection in an increasingly complex digital world.
