546.0,Bhopal: Crime Branch Arrests Two Cyber Fraudsters From Noida For Luring Job Seekers And Scamming Them - Free Press Journal,Free Press Journal,"Tue, 01 Apr 2025 07:00:00 GMT",https://www.freepressjournal.in/bhopal/bhopal-crime-branch-arrests-two-cyber-fraudsters-from-noida-for-luring-job-seekers-and-scamming-them,success_decoder,success,Bhopal: Crime Branch Arrests Two Cyber Fraudsters From Noida For Luring Job Seekers And Scamming Them,Staff Reporter,2025-04-01,"Bhopal (Madhya Pradesh): Bhopal crime branch have arrested two cyber fraudsters for cheating people in the name of giving jobs, from Noida, officials said here on Tuesday.
