647.0,Man Loses Over ₹22.10 Lakh In Online Trading Scam - Deccan Chronicle,Deccan Chronicle,"Wed, 10 Dec 2025 08:00:00 GMT",https://www.deccanchronicle.com/southern-states/telangana/man-loses-over-2210-lakh-in-online-trading-scam-1923024,success_decoder,success,Man Loses Over ₹22.10 Lakh In Online Trading Scam,Priya Rathnam,2025-12-10,"Man Loses Over ₹22.10 Lakh In Online Trading Scam
