695.0,Bengaluru woman loses ₹24 crore to scammers during 5-month-long digital arrest: Here's how it unfolded - Livemint,Livemint,"Sun, 24 May 2026 07:00:00 GMT",https://www.livemint.com/news/india/bengaluru-woman-loses-rs-24-crore-to-scammers-during-5-month-long-digital-arrest-heres-how-it-unfolded-11779623039305.html,success_decoder,success,Bengaluru woman loses ₹24 crore to scammers during 5-month-long digital arrest: Here's how it unfolded | Today News,Akriti Anand,2026-05-24,"The Central Crime Branch (CCB) busted what is being dubbed as Karnataka’s biggest “digital arrest” cyber fraud case. The cybercrime sleuths of the CCB reportedly arrested five accused in a massive online scam.
