New Delhi, July 15 (PTI) Over half of internet users surveyed faced fraud over the past year, and 45 per cent became victims of attacks on their devices, accounts or data, according to a new global survey by Kaspersky.
The scam landscape continues to evolve rapidly, becoming more sophisticated and targeted, and attacks are increasingly powered by AI, the release by Kaspersky, cautioned.
