724.0,"Airtel cracks down on online fraud in T.N., blocks 1,80,000 malicious links - The Hindu",The Hindu,"Thu, 12 Jun 2025 07:00:00 GMT",https://www.thehindu.com/news/cities/chennai/airtel-cracks-down-on-online-fraud-in-tn-blocks-180000-malicious-links/article69682888.ece,success_decoder,success,"Airtel cracks down on online fraud in T.N., blocks 1,80,000 malicious links",The Hindu Bureau,2025-06-12,"As part of the nationwide rollout of its artificial intelligence (AI)-powered fraud detection system, Airtel has blocked over 1,80,000 malicious links and safeguarded more than 3 million users across the State.
