771.0,"Congress claims BJP used AI to beautify Patna in viral video, targets PM: 'If Modi is there, then there's fraud' - Livemint",Livemint,"Thu, 04 Jun 2026 07:00:00 GMT",https://www.livemint.com/news/india/congress-claims-bjp-used-ai-to-beautify-patna-in-viral-video-targets-pm-if-modi-is-there-then-theres-fraud-11780586817190.html,success_decoder,success,"Congress claims BJP used AI to beautify Patna in viral video, targets PM: 'If Modi is there, then there's fraud' | Today News",Anjali Thakur,2026-06-04,"Anjali Thakur
