862.0,Investors sue Selena Gomez for alleged start-up fraud - indiagazette.com,indiagazette.com,"Sat, 15 Aug 2026 12:39:00 GMT",https://www.indiagazette.com/news/279242077/investors-sue-selena-gomez-for-alleged-start-up-fraud,success_decoder,success,Investors sue Selena Gomez for alleged start-up fraud,,2026-08-15,"Anabelle Colaco
                
