1095.0,"Cyber gang busted in Shivpuri for ‘digital arrest’ blackmail: ₹2.5 cr fraud uncovered, obscene calls made v... - Bhaskar English",Bhaskar English,"Sat, 21 Feb 2026 08:00:00 GMT",https://www.bhaskarenglish.in/local/mp/news/shivpuri-cyber-gang-25-crore-fraud-digital-arrest-blackmail-137262932.html,success_decoder,success,"Cyber gang busted in Shivpuri for ‘digital arrest’ blackmail: ₹2.5 cr fraud uncovered, obscene calls made via 10 apps - Madhya Pradesh News",,2026-02-21,"- English News
