1106.0,Elderly Man In Maharashtra Duped Of Rs 14 Lakh After Semi-Nude WhatsApp Video Call Scam - News18,News18,"Thu, 01 May 2025 07:00:00 GMT",https://www.news18.com/india/elderly-man-in-maharashtra-duped-of-rs-14-lakh-after-semi-nude-whatsapp-video-call-scam-ws-dl-9320321.html,success_decoder,success,Elderly Man In Maharashtra Duped Of Rs 14 Lakh After Semi-Nude WhatsApp Video Call Scam,Satyaki Baidya,2025-05-01,"Elderly Man In Maharashtra Duped Of Rs 14 Lakh After Semi-Nude WhatsApp Video Call Scam
While bathing on March 23, the elderly man received a WhatsApp video call from an unknown number; a nude woman appeared, recorded him semi-nude and used it to blackmail him
An elderly resident of Sandeshnagar, Chhatrapati Sambhaji Nagar in Maharashtra, was blackmailed and extorted after a WhatsApp video call on March 23, where a woman recorded him in a semi-nude state. Over a month, the scammers extorted Rs 14,66,773 from him.
On the morning of March 23, while the elderly man was bathing, he received a WhatsApp video call from an unknown number. Upon answering, he saw a young woman in a nude state, while he was semi-nude. The woman recorded the call and used the footage to threaten him.
