1170.0,"7 held in Rajasthan, Bihar for NEET impersonation - The Times of India",The Times of India,"Tue, 06 May 2025 07:00:00 GMT",https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/7-held-in-rajasthan-bihar-for-neet-impersonation/articleshow/120910774.cms,success_decoder,success,"7 held in Rajasthan, Bihar for NEET impersonation | India News - The Times of India",TNN; Updated May 6,2025-05-06,"- News
