1521.0,Dahod Fake ST Certificate Scam: OBC Family Allegedly Secure… - GujaratSamachar English,GujaratSamachar English,"Thu, 06 Aug 2026 07:00:00 GMT",https://english.gujaratsamachar.com/news/dahod/dahod-fake-st-certificate-scam-obc-family-allegedly-secured-govt-jobs-medical-seats-and-petrol-pump-under-tribal-quota-81248275248,success_decoder,success,Dahod Fake ST Certificate Scam: OBC Family Allegedly Secure…,Shireen,2026-08-06,"Dahod Fake ST Certificate Scam: OBC Family Allegedly Secured Govt Jobs, Medical Seats and Petrol Pump Under Tribal Quota
