1627.0,AI catches dummy candidate in recruitment scam: Candidate appeared in 3 exams for his brothers using fake d... - Bhaskar English,Bhaskar English,"Tue, 21 Oct 2025 07:00:00 GMT",https://www.bhaskarenglish.in/local/rajasthan/jaipur/news/aicatches-dummy-candidate-in-recruitment-scam-appeared-in-three-exams-for-brothers-using-fake-documents-136221991.html,success_decoder,success,"AI catches dummy candidate in recruitment scam: Candidate appeared in 3 exams for his brothers using fake documents, cheating the system successfully - Jaipur News",,2025-10-21,"- English News
