It was also alleged that Fernandez wanted to marry Chandrashekhar even after knowing all the allegations against him and that she visited him multiple times when he was on interim bail.
“Is it believable that a Bollywood actress of her calibre could be fooled by hiding a real identity and have a serious relationship over a year….and that she was just a little child who did not know anything?” asked Chandrasekhar.
Referring to her as “Jackie”, the alleged conman also wished Fernandez a Merry Christmas.
“I hereby, Jackie, Wish You a Very Merry Christmas, and also wanted to tell you that by creating these fake chats and publishing it, what are you trying to prove to the world? That I am desperate for you? If that is what you want to show, then the world knows through my other actions that it is the fact that I am desperately in love with you. For this, you need not have to make an effort by creating such fake chats. It’s alright. It’s all fair in love and war,” he remarked.",412,,True,False
