1869.0,"Meta AI impersonated celebrities like Anne Hathaway, Selena Gomez, Scarlett Johansson, Taylor Swift in flirty and explicit chats - The Indian Express",The Indian Express,"Sat, 30 Aug 2025 07:00:00 GMT",https://indianexpress.com/article/technology/artificial-intelligence/meta-ai-anne-hathaway-selena-gomez-taylor-swift-scarlett-johansson-10219929/,success_decoder,success,"Meta AI impersonated celebrities like Anne Hathaway, Selena Gomez, Scarlett Johansson, Taylor Swift in flirty and explicit chats",Tech Desk,2025-08-30,"- Tags:
