2133.0,"Indians targeted in massive overseas scam: How SIM cards activated at home, smuggled abroad and used to run... - Bhaskar English",Bhaskar English,"Mon, 16 Feb 2026 05:19:25 GMT",https://www.bhaskarenglish.in/tech-science/news/sim-card-fraud-calls-india-cbi-i4c-cybercrime-137219380.html,success_decoder,success,"Indians targeted in massive overseas scam: How SIM cards activated at home, smuggled abroad and used to run fraud calls back into India",Samira Siddiqui,2026-02-16,"- English News
