2176.0,Fact Check: Singer Neha Kakkar Arrested In Trading Scam Case? AI-Generated Fake Photos Go Viral - News18,News18,"Tue, 14 Jan 2025 08:00:00 GMT",https://www.news18.com/movies/fact-check-singer-neha-kakkar-arrested-in-trading-scam-case-ai-generated-fake-photos-go-viral-9188415.html,success_decoder,success,Fact Check: Singer Neha Kakkar Arrested In Trading Scam Case? AI-Generated Fake Photos Go Viral,Chirag Sehgal,2025-01-14,"Fact Check: Singer Neha Kakkar Arrested In Trading Scam Case? AI-Generated Fake Photos Go Viral
The viral photos of singer Neha Kakkar's arrest have been generated by AI. Read on to know more.
Singer Neha Kakkar’s fans were recently left shocked after some pictures of her getting arrested surfaced on social media. In the viral clicks, Neha was seen crying as she walked with a policeman holding her hand. The photo was shared by a user named ‘Indianews 3’ with the caption, “Tragic end to Neha Kakkar’s career! This morning’s news was a shock to all Indian people! (sic).""
However, soon after the pictures were shared, it was revealed that they were fake. The viral photos have been generated by AI. In the original pictures, a woman was being arrested by police officials. However, the the viral clicks, the woman’s face was swapped with that of Neha Kakkar. The singer is yet to react to the viral photos as of now.
