In 2020, Neha married singer Rohanpreet Singh in Delhi. However, in 2024, their divorce rumours made headlines and left everyone shocked. Later in an interview with ETimes, Rohanpreet addressed the speculation, affirming that the couple remains unaffected by such gossip.
“Any kind of rumour doesn’t bother us or affect our relationship. We are mentally touchwood so prepared that these rumours which are obviously untrue don’t affect us or our bond. Jo sach he nahi hai Woh kaise aap apne relationship par haavi hone de sakte ho. (If it isn’t true, how can you let it affect your relationship?) I don’t think anybody should mind such baseless rumours. Kuch toh log kahenge logon ka kaam hai kehna (People have always say something, it is their job to talk). If they are happy talking about us, they can happily do it,"" he said.",454,,True,False
2177.0,Trade 350 App Review 2025: Scam or Legit? - Truth Exposed! - Republic World,Republic World,"Mon, 12 May 2025 07:00:00 GMT",https://www.republicworld.com/initiatives/trade-350-app-review-2025-scam-or-legit-truth-exposed,success_decoder,success,Trade 350 App Review 2025: Scam or Legit? - Truth Exposed!,Republic World,2025-05-12,"Trade 350 App Review 2025: Scam or Legit? - Truth Exposed!
