2232.0,"Fraudsters stealing people's identity: Voice imitation leading to face-voice cloning, avoid this scam by fo... - Bhaskar English",Bhaskar English,"Sat, 27 Jun 2026 07:00:00 GMT",https://www.bhaskarenglish.in/tech-science/news/cyber-literacy-fraudsters-stealing-peoples-identity-138308357.html,success_decoder,success,"Fraudsters stealing people's identity: Voice imitation leading to face-voice cloning, avoid this scam by following these 10 precautions",,2026-06-28,"- English News
- Tech science
