2252.0,Fake 'Supreme Court' scam drains Gandhinagar ex-geologist’s retirement savings: Fraudsters threaten with TR... - Bhaskar English,Bhaskar English,"Fri, 02 Jan 2026 08:00:00 GMT",https://www.bhaskarenglish.in/local/gujarat/news/fake-supreme-court-scam-gandhinagar-ex-geologist-loses-40-lakh-in-digital-arrest-fraud-136841985.html,success_decoder,success,"Fake 'Supreme Court' scam drains Gandhinagar ex-geologist’s retirement savings: Fraudsters threaten with TRAI case, extort ₹40 lakh; digital arrest scam exposed - Gujarat News",,2026-01-02,"- English News
