Multi-State Scam Revealed
Investigations have uncovered that the call originated from a Haryana SIM, the money was transferred to a bank account in Uttar Pradesh, and it was withdrawn from an ATM in Bihar. This pattern points to a coordinated interstate cybercrime network, complicating tracking and investigations.
