2291.0,"UP: Class 8 boy outsmarts ‘Digital Arrest’ scam, saves parents after 10-hour ordeal - Odisha TV",Odisha TV,"Tue, 14 Apr 2026 07:00:00 GMT",https://odishatv.in/viral/up-class-8-boy-outsmarts-digital-arrest-scam-saves-parents-after-10-hour-ordeal-11725881,success_decoder,success,"UP: Class 8 boy outsmarts ‘Digital Arrest’ scam, saves parents after 10-hour ordeal",Nitesh Kumar Sahoo,2026-04-14,"In a chilling case from Bareilly, Uttar Pradesh, a couple endured nearly 10 hours of what cybercriminals call a “digital arrest.” Posing as law enforcement officials, scammers accused them of links to terrorism, displayed fake warrants over a video call, and ordered them to remain connected at all times. The couple, gripped by fear, complied—too intimidated to question the situation.
