How the Scam Works
This emerging cybercrime tactic involves fraudsters impersonating police or government agencies. Victims are threatened with arrest or legal action and coerced into isolation while being pressured to reveal sensitive financial information.
According to advisories from the Indian Cyber Crime Coordination Centre, such scams have seen a rise across India, exploiting fear and urgency to override rational thinking.
