Following their instructions, the victim liquidated his fixed deposits and transferred over Rs 46 lakh between Feb 27 and March 3 in three transactions. The fraud came to light in the first week of April when the victim visited his bank and discussed the transactions with bank officials. Based on his complaint, Hyderabad cybercrime police registered a case under relevant sections of the BNS and the IT Act on Thursday.",392,,True,False
