A 20-year-old trader from Ahmedabad has allegedly lost nearly ₹1.39 lakh after fraudsters gained unauthorised access to his Union Bank account and carried out multiple UPI transactions over two days. Meghaninagar police have registered a cyber fraud case against unidentified persons and launched an investigation into the digital trail.
