2730.0,​​​​​​​Ahmedabad Cybercrime Branch busts multi-state fake banking network: Police nab 11 in bogus scam; fra... - Bhaskar English,Bhaskar English,"Thu, 13 Feb 2025 08:00:00 GMT",https://www.bhaskarenglish.in/local/gujarat/ahmedabad/news/ahmedabad-cybercrime-branch-nab-11-operating-bogus-bank-account-network-in-gujarat-13-february-2025-134467504.html,success_decoder,success,"Ahmedabad Cybercrime Branch busts multi-state fake banking network: Police nab 11 in bogus scam; fraudulent accounts, Aadhaar-linked documents seized - Ahmedabad News",Aziz Cutleriwala,2025-02-13,"- English News
