2830.0,Seven cybercons arrested for digital arrest scam in Andhra Pradesh - The Times of India,The Times of India,"Tue, 28 Jan 2025 08:00:00 GMT",https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/city/vijayawada/seven-cybercons-arrested-for-digital-arrest-scam-in-andhra-pradesh/articleshow/117649089.cms,success_decoder,success,Seven cybercons arrested for digital arrest scam in Andhra Pradesh | Vijayawada News - The Times of India,Sandeep Raghavan,2025-01-28,"- News
