2832.0,"‘Digital Arrest’ fraud: CBI conducts searches across Telangana, AP - The Siasat Daily",The Siasat Daily,"Sun, 19 Apr 2026 07:00:00 GMT",https://www.siasat.com/digital-arrest-fraud-cbi-conducts-searches-across-telangana-ap-3456159/,success_decoder,success,"'Digital Arrest' fraud: CBI conducts searches across Telangana, AP",News Desk,2026-04-19,"Hyderabad: The Central Bureau of Investigation (CBI) on Sunday, April 19, conducted searches at five locations across Telangana and Andhra Pradesh in connection with a “digital arrest” cyber fraud case. Three individuals, including a bank official, have been arrested so far.
The case is being probed by the CBI following directions from the Supreme Court. According to officials, the victim — a senior citizen — was allegedly coerced into transferring more than Rs 1.6 crore under threats of a so-called “digital arrest.”
