3103.0,"Mobile hotspot lands garage mechanic in jail in cyber fraud case, gets bail after 3 months - GujaratSamachar English",GujaratSamachar English,"Sun, 28 Jun 2026 12:12:45 GMT",https://english.gujaratsamachar.com/news/gujarat/mobile-hotspot-lands-garage-mechanic-in-jail-in-cyber-fraud-case-gets-bail-after-3-months-44298638568,success_decoder,success,Mobile hotspot lands garage mechanic in jail in cyber fraud…,Dhruv Kayasth,2026-04-15,"Mobile hotspot lands garage mechanic in jail in cyber fraud case, gets bail after 3 months
