3365.0,2 men from Mumbai arrested for digital arrest fraud - The Times of India,The Times of India,"Tue, 30 Jun 2026 07:00:00 GMT",https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/city/bhubaneswar/2-men-from-mumbai-arrested-for-digital-arrest-fraud/articleshow/132096038.cms,success_decoder,success,2 men from Mumbai arrested for digital arrest fraud,Malay Ray,2026-06-30,"Rourkela: Rourkela police on Tuesday busted Rs 14.36 lakh digital arrest cyber fraud case in which a local resident had been cheated and arrested two members of an inter-state syndicate from Mumbai. The arrested duo were identified as Nayan Lalit Nathwani, 47, and Dhabal Paresh Pandya, 35, both GST brokers. Police seized two mobile phones and documents linked to financial transfers from them.
