3676.0,Delhi Police busts inter-state 'digital arrest' network; 4 held for cyber-fraud - ANI News,ANI News,"Fri, 21 Aug 2026 04:05:00 GMT",https://www.aninews.in/news/national/general-news/delhi-police-busts-inter-state-digital-arrest-network-4-held-for-cyber-fraud20260821093515,success_decoder,success,Delhi Police busts inter-state 'digital arrest' network; 4 held for cyber-fraud,ANI,2026-08-30,"New Delhi [India], August 21 (ANI): The Cyber Police Station of Delhi's South-West District has dismantled an inter-state cyber-fraud facilitation network linked to ""digital arrest"" scams, arresting four key operatives across Punjab and Rajasthan, officials said on Friday.
