A technical investigation and analysis of the money trail revealed that an amount of ₹17.3 lakh was credited to the bank account of the accused. He hails from Gaya district in Bihar. During interrogation, he disclosed that two other persons were also involved with him in the case, police said. They are yet to be arrested. The accused was presented in a court that sent him to judicial custody on Saturday.",333,,True,False
