3923.0,Lawyer arrested by cybercrime wing of Bengal Police for ‘digital arrest’ racket - Telegraph India,Telegraph India,"Sat, 23 May 2026 07:00:00 GMT",https://www.telegraphindia.com/west-bengal/kolkata/lawyer-arrested-by-cybercrime-wing-of-bengal-police-for-digital-arrest-racket-operation-prnt/cid/2161949,success_decoder,success,Lawyer arrested by cybercrime wing of Bengal Police for ‘digital arrest’ racket,Monalisa Chaudhuri,2026-05-23,"The cybercrime wing of Bengal Police said it had unearthed a digital arrest racket and picked up a man allegedly operating a bank account in Murshidabad, where money from victims of at least 41 such cases had been deposited.
