The complainant said the ordeal began in May 2021, when he got connected to a woman named Kim, alias Prianka Sangm, on Facebook. She claimed to be an air hostess with Dubai-based Emirates Airlines. The two began chatting regularly, and the man was convinced of Kim's genuineness, as she shared photographs from inside the aircraft and personal images to strengthen her false identity.
