4082.0,"CBI conducts searches across Punjab, Haryana, 14 other states in digital arrest scam cases - The Tribune",The Tribune,"Thu, 25 Jun 2026 07:00:00 GMT",https://www.tribuneindia.com/news/punjab/cbi-conducts-searches-across-punjab-haryana-14-other-states-in-digital-arrest-scam-cases/,success_decoder,success,"CBI conducts searches across Punjab, Haryana, 14 other states in digital arrest scam cases - The Tribune",Animesh Singh,2026-06-25,"CBI conducts searches across Punjab, Haryana, 14 other states in digital arrest scam cases
