 between Aug and Sept 2025. The victim was placed under a âdigital arrestâ by fraudsters posing as officials from the Telecom Regulatory Authority of India (TRAI) and the CBI. Under the threat of arrest for alleged money laundering, the victim was coerced into transferring Rs 58.13 crore to various bank accounts.
