4090.0,Ahmedabad cyber crime: two held from Jodhpur for ₹44 lakh ‘digital arrest’ fraud - GujaratSamachar English,GujaratSamachar English,"Sat, 08 Aug 2026 07:00:00 GMT",https://english.gujaratsamachar.com/news/ahmedabad/ahmedabad-cyber-crime-two-held-from-jodhpur-for-indian-rupee44-lakh-digital-arrest-fraud-66078613518,success_decoder,success,Ahmedabad cyber crime: two held from Jodhpur for ₹44 lakh ‘…,Shireen,2026-08-08,"Ahmedabad cyber crime: two held from Jodhpur for ₹44 lakh ‘digital arrest’ fraud
