4096.0,Mumbai woman loses Rs 20 crore in one of India's longest 'digital arrest' scams - The Times of India,The Times of India,"Tue, 18 Mar 2025 07:00:00 GMT",https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/technology/tech-news/mumbai-woman-loses-rs-20-crore-in-one-of-indias-longest-digital-arrest-scams/articleshow/119112145.cms,success_decoder,success,Mumbai woman loses Rs 20 crore in one of India's longest 'digital arrest' scams - The Times of India,TOI Tech Desk,2025-03-17,"In a startling cyber fraud case, an 86-year-old Mumbai woman lost Rs 20.25 crore in one of India's longest-running 'digital arrest' scams. Between December 26, 2024, and March 3, 2025, scammers posing as police officials manipulated her through fear of legal trouble, coercing her into transferring the money.
