4174.0,"Fraudsters Use Digital Arrest To Extort Rs 59 Lakh From Senior Citizen, Arrested - Deccan Chronicle",Deccan Chronicle,"Sat, 20 Dec 2025 08:00:00 GMT",https://www.deccanchronicle.com/southern-states/telangana/fraudsters-use-digital-arrest-to-extort-rs-59-lakh-from-senior-citizen-arrested-1925086,success_decoder,success,"Fraudsters Use Digital Arrest To Extort Rs 59 Lakh From Senior Citizen, Arrested",DC Correspondent,2025-12-20,"Fraudsters Use Digital Arrest To Extort Rs 59 Lakh From Senior Citizen, Arrested
