4200.0,"Centre May Soon Criminalise Deepfakes, 'Digital Arrest' With New Law After Supreme Court Push - News18",News18,"Wed, 29 Jul 2026 07:00:00 GMT",https://www.news18.com/india/centre-may-soon-criminalise-deepfakes-digital-arrest-with-new-law-after-supreme-court-push-ws-l-10239404.html,success_decoder,success,"Centre May Soon Criminalise Deepfakes, 'Digital Arrest' With New Law After Supreme Court Push",Apoorva Misra,2026-07-29,"Centre May Soon Criminalise Deepfakes, 'Digital Arrest' With New Law After Supreme Court Push
