4227.0,"₹25.65 Lakh Siphoned In Digital Arrest Fraud In Bhopal, CBI Steps In - Free Press Journal",Free Press Journal,"Thu, 16 Apr 2026 07:00:00 GMT",https://www.freepressjournal.in/bhopal/2565-lakh-siphoned-in-digital-arrest-fraud-in-bhopal-cbi-steps-in,success_decoder,success,"₹25.65 Lakh Siphoned In Digital Arrest Fraud In Bhopal, CBI Steps In",Staff Reporter,2026-04-17,"Bhopal (Madhya Pradesh): The CBI, Bhopal, has registered a case in connection with a digital arrest scam in which a retired employee of the irrigation department was robbed by cyber fraudsters. The case was registered following suo motu cognisance taken per Supreme Court orders.
