4255.0,Three Persons Held For 'Digital Arrest' Scam - ETV Bharat,ETV Bharat,"Tue, 21 Jan 2025 08:00:00 GMT",https://www.etvbharat.com/en/!state/three-persons-held-for-digital-arrest-scam-enn25012102024,success_decoder,success,Three Persons Held For 'Digital Arrest' Scam,ETV Bharat,2025-01-21,"Three Persons Held For 'Digital Arrest' Scam
