, also known by the aliases âMecco', âKenny' and âKenny Patel', the fugitive has been accused of masterminding what investigators describe as a nationwide ""digital arrest"" scam between 2017 and 2021. Sources privy to the development said Patel hails from North Gujarat and allegedly entered the US through an illegal route in 2015 before embedding himself in the fraud ecosystem.
