4351.0,"Mumbai: Elderly woman loses ₹1.5 crore in ‘digital arrest’, scammers pose as SIT officers | India News - Hindustan Times",Hindustan Times,"Thu, 02 Jan 2025 08:00:00 GMT",https://www.hindustantimes.com/india-news/mumbai-elderly-woman-loses-rs-1-5-crore-in-digital-arrest-scammers-pose-as-sit-officers-101735820771904.html,success_decoder,success,"Mumbai: Elderly woman loses ₹1.5 crore in ‘digital arrest’, scammers pose as SIT officers",HT News Desk,2025-01-02,"Mumbai: Elderly woman loses ₹1.5 crore in ‘digital arrest’, scammers pose as SIT officers
