4357.0,Kongad MLA escapes ‘digital arrest’ scam after hours-long ordeal - The Hindu,The Hindu,"Sat, 07 Mar 2026 08:00:00 GMT",https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/kerala/kongad-mla-escapes-digital-arrest-scam-after-hours-long-ordeal/article70716400.ece,success_decoder,success,Kongad MLA escapes ‘digital arrest’ scam after hours-long ordeal,The Hindu Bureau,2026-03-07,"CPI(M)’s Kongad MLA K. Santhakumari narrowly escaped falling victim to a sophisticated online fraud in which scammers tried to convince her that she was under “digital arrest” over alleged links to a terror case.
