4360.0,Kozhikode cyber police gather key evidence in digital arrest scam - The Hindu,The Hindu,"Sun, 11 Jan 2026 08:00:00 GMT",https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/kerala/digital-arrest-scam-kozhikode-cyber-police-gather-key-evidence-from-arrested-youths/article70497605.ece,success_decoder,success,Kozhikode cyber police gather key evidence in digital arrest scam,The Hindu Bureau,2026-01-11,"The Kozhikode cyber police have made a major breakthrough in the ongoing investigation into a few digital arrest scams with the recent arrest of four youths involved in a ₹36-lakh fraud. Investigators said that the evidence recovered from the four would help probe several other cases registered in the district and expose a chain of suspected scamsters.
