4363.0,Delhi Police arrest 10 persons for inter-State digital fraud - The Hindu,The Hindu,"Tue, 16 Dec 2025 08:00:00 GMT",https://www.thehindu.com/news/cities/Delhi/delhi-police-arrest-10-persons-for-inter-state-digital-fraud/article70403872.ece,success_decoder,success,Delhi Police arrest 10 persons for inter-State digital fraud,The Hindu Bureau,2025-12-16,"The Delhi Police have arrested 10 persons involved in an inter-State digital fraud, amounting to over ₹50 crore, by impersonating law enforcement officials.
