4371.0,"WhatsApp bans over 9,400 accounts linked to digital arrest scams - madhyamamonline.com",madhyamamonline.com,"Tue, 28 Apr 2026 07:00:00 GMT",https://madhyamamonline.com/technology/whatsapp-bans-over-9400-accounts-linked-to-digital-arrest-scams-1515369,success_decoder,success,"WhatsApp bans over 9,400 accounts linked to digital arrest scams",Web Desk,2026-04-28,"WhatsApp bans over 9,400 accounts linked to digital arrest scams
