4404.0,"Digital arrest scam goes global: 16 from Bengaluru held for duping US, Canada citizens - The News Minute",The News Minute,"Tue, 14 Oct 2025 07:00:00 GMT",https://www.thenewsminute.com/karnataka/digital-arrest-scam-goes-global-16-from-bengaluru-held-for-duping-us-canada-citizens,success_decoder,success,"Digital arrest scam goes global: 16 from Bengaluru held for duping US, Canada citizens",TNM Staff,2025-10-14,"Karnataka
