4444.0,Retired woman loses Rs21 lakh in digital arrest fraud - The Times of India,The Times of India,"Fri, 27 Mar 2026 07:00:00 GMT",https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/city/pune/retired-woman-loses-rs21-lakh-in-digital-arrest-fraud/articleshow/129833491.cms,success_decoder,success,Retired woman loses Rs21 lakh in digital arrest fraud | Pune News - The Times of India,TNN; Mar,2026-03-27,"Pune: Cybercrooks posing as telecom department officials duped a 68-year-old retired woman from Hadapsar of Rs 20.70 lakh in a recent digital arrest scam between Jan and Feb this year.
