5004.0,"Foreigner forged MOM letters, cheated maid of over $2k with promise of S’pore jobs for her relatives - The Straits Times",The Straits Times,"Tue, 29 Jul 2025 07:00:00 GMT",https://www.straitstimes.com/singapore/courts-crime/foreigner-forged-mom-letters-cheated-maid-of-over-2k-with-promise-to-help-her-relatives-get-jobs-in,success_decoder,success,"Foreigner forged MOM letters, cheated maid of over $2k with promise of S’pore jobs for her relatives",Christine Tan,2025-07-29,"Foreigner forged MOM letters, cheated maid of over $2k with promise of S’pore jobs for her relatives
- Indian national Charanjeet Singh, 20, jailed 13 weeks for swindling a domestic worker of $2,135 by falsely promising jobs for her relatives.
